name objective-window-late-loss-1
timeout 280

# THE DECLARED SPAN, AS A RUN (round E17). `objective ... until <s>` freezes an objective's state at a
# sim time the MISSION names instead of one the run's events choose (doc/missions/verdict.md, "The
# seventh thing in the vocabulary"). This file is the measurement that the freeze is REAL on the one
# case where it is load-bearing: A CLOSED OBJECTIVE CANNOT BE VIOLATED.
#
# THE CONSTRUCTION: `objective-covers-none.fbm`, byte for byte, with `until 60` on the STRIKER's
# `survive` and on nothing else. In that file the striker is shot combat-ineffective at t = 70.7 s, its
# `survive` is violated, its own FAIL is decisive and the run exits 1. Here its span closes at t = 60.0,
# ten seconds before the shot, and the defender's three objectives stay unwindowed so that the run keeps
# running and the shot actually happens.
#
# READING RULE (binding): the striker's own line must read `result=SUCCESS` with
# `survive until 60 state=met` WHILE `damage KILL unit=striker` stands in the same log below it. That is
# the whole rule: a closed objective cannot be violated, because the sortie it was declared over is over.
# MEASURED: `WINDOW_CLOSED ... survive until 60 state=met` at t = 60.0, `damage KILL unit=striker` at
# t = 70.6, `UNIT_RESULT unit=striker result=SUCCESS reason="objectives met"` at t = 280.1. The wreck
# never reaches the ground inside the timeout, so the run ends on the clock: **exit 0 here against exit 1
# in `objective-covers-none.fbm`**, and the difference is one clause on one line.

unit defender
  team friendly
  module f16
  spawn 46.90000 6.60000 8000 90.0 400
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode acm_hud
  set fcr_range_nm 40
  set store 3 aim120
  set store 7 aim120
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set brief_release_s 20
  wp 46.90000 7.15000 8000 400
  objective identify unit striker range 60000 hold 5
  objective deny release unit striker
  objective survive

unit striker
  team hostile
  module f16
  spawn 46.90000 7.30000 8000 270.0 400
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set store 3 mk82
  set store 7 mk82
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set brief_release_s 90
  wp 46.90000 6.75000 8000 400
  objective survive until 60                 # so it CARRIES a monitor: only a judged unit can decide
